      "description": {
        "en": "Converts the moments you reach for the mouse into shortcuts you pick yourself: back to the conversation, focus the composer, switch pages, open DevTools, and a session switcher that holds Alt and lets go to commit (DSH NEXT on Windows).",
        "zh": "把「又想伸手拿鼠标」的时刻变成你自己选的组合键：返回会话、聚焦输入框、切换功能页、打开 DevTools，以及按住 Alt 扫视、松手才切换的会话轮切板（DSH NEXT + Windows）。"
